  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitMove-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '1', title: "Your Knee Shouldn't Decide How Much You Move.", subtitle: 'Walking, stairs, workouts and long hours on your feet put repeated stress through your knees.', heading_id: 'DialFitMove' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>DialFit gives you <strong>adjustable support exactly when you need it</strong> — without locking your leg inside a bulky rigid brace.</p></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitSupport-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '2', title: 'More Support When Your Knee Needs It Most', subtitle: 'Ordinary compression sleeves give you one fixed level of pressure.', heading_id: 'DialFitSupport' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>Too loose and they barely feel supportive. Too tight and they become uncomfortable fast.</p><p>DialFit changes that. Its dial-controlled tension system lets you fine-tune the fit around your knee in seconds, helping the knee feel more secure and supported while you walk, work, train or move through your day.</p><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Tighten it when you need more support. Ease it when you don't.</p></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitBenefits-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '3', title: 'Why Your Knees Will Love DialFit', subtitle: 'Purpose-built support that adapts to your day.', heading_id: 'DialFitBenefits' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-grid">
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Dial-Controlled Support</h3><p>Fine-tune the tension in seconds instead of relying on fixed compression.</p></article>
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Patella Cushioning</h3><p>A cushioned ring surrounds the kneecap to help absorb impact during movement.</p></article>
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Flexible Side Stability</h3><p>Support along both sides helps your knee feel steadier without the bulk of a rigid brace.</p></article>
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>4-Way Stretch</h3><p>Flexible fabric moves with your leg instead of fighting against it.</p></article>
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Lightweight Design</h3><p>At approximately 158 g, it delivers support without feeling like heavy sports equipment.</p></article>
      <article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Built for Long Days on Your Feet</h3><p>Adjust knee-focused support throughout long shifts spent standing and walking.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitMechanism-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '4', title: 'The Difference Is in the Dial.', subtitle: "Your knee doesn't need the exact same amount of support every minute of the day.", heading_id: 'DialFitMechanism' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>Turn the dial and the integrated tension system draws the brace more securely around your knee. Need more support before a workout, a long walk or a busy shift? Tighten it. Sitting down or want less pressure? Adjust it again.</p><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">No endless strap readjustment. No guessing. Just dial in the fit you want.</p><h2 style="margin-top:32px">Support From Every Angle</h2></div>
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-grid"><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Precision Dial</h3><p>Controls the tension around the knee.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Integrated Tension System</h3><p>Distributes adjustable support around the brace.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Flexible Side Supports</h3><p>Adds structure on both sides while allowing natural bending.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Patella Cushion</h3><p>Adds targeted cushioning around the kneecap.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Stretch Knit</h3><p>Contours around the leg while allowing natural movement.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Breathable Construction</h3><p>Designed for active, everyday wear.</p></article></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitHow-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '5', title: 'Support Your Knee in Seconds', subtitle: 'Four simple steps to dial in your support.', heading_id: 'DialFitHow' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-grid apdp-dialfit-steps"><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>SLIDE IT ON</h3><p>Pull DialFit over the correct knee like a compression sleeve.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>CENTER THE KNEECAP</h3><p>Position the cushioned support ring comfortably around your kneecap.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>TURN THE DIAL</h3><p>Adjust the tension until your knee feels secure and supported.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>MOVE</h3><p>Walk, work, train or go about your day — and readjust whenever you need to.</p></article></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-tail alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitCompare-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
