    <div class="apdp-dialfit-compare" role="table" aria-label="Ordinary knee sleeve compared with Altaeron DialFit"><div class="apdp-dialfit-compare__head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Ordinary Knee Sleeve</span><span role="columnheader">Altaeron™ DialFit</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">Fixed compression</span><span role="cell">Adjustable tension</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">Cannot easily change support</span><span role="cell">Dial it tighter or looser anytime</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">Little lateral stability</span><span role="cell">Flexible side support</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">Basic material around kneecap</span><span role="cell">Targeted patella cushioning</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">One feel all day</span><span role="cell">Adjust as your activity changes</span></div><div role="row"><span role="cell">Basic slip-on support</span><span role="cell">Dial-controlled supportive fit</span></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" aria-labelledby="DialFitUses-{{ section.id }}"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">
    {% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '7', title: 'From Morning Walks to 12-Hour Shifts', subtitle: 'Adjustable knee-focused support for active days and everyday movement.', heading_id: 'DialFitUses' %}
    <div class="apdp-dialfit-grid"><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Walking & Stairs</h3><p>Extra knee support when every step puts repeated pressure through the joint.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Gym & Squats</h3><p>Dial in a more secure feel before loading and bending your legs.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Running & Sports</h3><p>Lightweight adjustable support designed to move with you.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Long Shifts on Your Feet</h3><p>Useful for nurses, teachers, retail, hospitality and anyone spending hours standing or walking.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Tired, Heavy Legs</h3><p>Adds knee-focused support for daily movement, including for people who also experience discomfort associated with varicose veins. It is not a treatment for a vein condition.</p></article><article class="apdp-dialfit-card"><h3>Everyday Movement</h3><p>Wear it for errands, housework, commuting, gardening, travel or any day your knee could use extra support.</p></article></div>
  </div></section>

